 "_comment": [
  "D-SINK-47, D-SINK-48 (lane-p2a, 2026-10-29): the private arguments of a helper run, off",
  "the world-readable /proc/<pid>/cmdline and into the environment. Run by BOTH suites:",
  "tests/Model.test.js holds Model.helperSpawn to `command` and `private` for every",
  "`argv` (a builder's own output), and the harness's stand-in for the helper's expansion to",
  "`parsed`; tests/test_argv_secrets.py holds the helper's helper_arguments to `parsed` and",
  "proves argparse reads `parsed` exactly as it reads `argv`. `environment` is the run's own",
  "(a fetch's URL and provenance), kept beside the list. Reviewed by hand, case by case.",
